a.cpp\"`**: Specifies the **source directory** containing the CMakeLists.txt files (the downloaded git repo).\n*   **`-B \"${srcdir}/build\"`**: Specifies the **build directory** where intermediate object files and binaries will be generated. This keeps the source tree clean.\n*   **`-G Ninja`**: Selects **Ninja** as the build system backend instead of Make. Ninja is significantly faster for large C++ projects like `llama.cpp`.\n\n### 3. CMake Flags (Step-by-Step)\n\n#### Build Type & Installation Paths\n"}